    "body": "Maybe I am mistaken, but I believe the spec has canonically used the term \"active _session_ history entry\".\r\n\r\nOtherwise, looks good to me - this is the same change that I tried applying to Ladybird's implementation, but results in Ladybird crashing in [\"update document for history step application\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#update-document-for-history-step-application) after applying that patch due to a null document on the `previousEntryForActivation`. But I think that is for an unrelated issue I am still trying to investigate.",
